<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; background-color: #050505; margin: 0; padding: 0; color: #ffffff; }
    .container { max-width: 550px; margin: 40px auto; background-color: #0f0f0f; border: 1px solid #222; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; }
    .content { padding: 40px; }
    .badge-expired { display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 100px; background: #18181b; color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px; text-transform: uppercase; border: 1px solid #3f3f46; }
    h1 { font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 10px; color: #ffffff; }
    p { color: #a1a1aa; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 15px; }
    .feature-lock { color: #ef4444; font-size: 13px; margin: 8px 0; display: block; font-weight: 500; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; background: #ffffff; color: #000000 !important; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 20px; }
    .footer { padding: 20px 40px; background: #0a0a0a; border-top: 1px solid #1a1a1a; color: #52525b; font-size: 12px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content">
      <div class="badge-expired">Expired</div>
      <h1>Your access has reverted</h1>
      <p>Hello <%= userName %>, your premium subscription ended on <%= endDate %>. You have been moved back to our Free plan.</p>
      
      <div style="margin: 25px 0; background: #1a1a1a; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px;">
        <span class="feature-lock">&times; 4K Ultra HD Disabled</span>
        <span class="feature-lock">&times; Offline Downloads Paused</span>
        <span class="feature-lock">&times; Ad-Free Experience Revoked</span>
      </div>

      <p>Renew today to instantly restore your library and settings.</p>
      <a href="<%= loginUrl %>" class="btn">Restore Premium Access</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">Censura &bull; High-Performance Streaming</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>